            <title>1.0.4</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 22:59:01 -0700</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>2026102103</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.4</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>11.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# PEAR 1.0.4

- Fixes multi-user installations so both the parent and enrolled child macOS accounts can open PEAR.
- Normalizes app-bundle permissions before signing and packaging.
- Adds release checks that reject OTA archives containing owner-only files or folders.
]]></description>
