        </item>
        <item>
            <title>1.0.2</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 21:31:05 -0700</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>2026102101</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>11.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# PEAR 1.0.2

- Fixes fresh installation by creating PEAR's shared workspace automatically and recognizing the first macOS account as the owner.
- Repairs missing enrollment and child-data folders for existing owner installations.
- Prevents protected or stale Messages attachment paths from crashing the dashboard during launch.
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/hanskirch/pear-updates/releases/download/v1.0.2/PEAR-1.0.2.zip" length="29645527" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="WMSc+ZxDcTnN93xttjr214i55XrzapVIFLq7V6gbOW14T0NJG9VPmbH08GTYXoq73rSCMzjWLSml6512M34VBQ=="/>
        </item>
        <item>
            <title>1.0.1</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 16 Oct 2026 13:45:25 -0600</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>2026101602</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>11.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# PEAR 1.0.1

- Fixes first launch from a fresh DMG by creating PEAR's shared workspace automatically.
- Correctly recognizes the first macOS account to launch PEAR as the owner.
- Repairs missing enrollment and child-data folders for existing owner installations.
- Prevents the `No such file or directory: /Users/Shared/PEAR/enrollments/...` enrollment failure.
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/hanskirch/pear-updates/releases/download/v1.0.1/PEAR-1.0.1.zip" length="29644845" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="WkQYr9KdWvazgz7/ZBdyTKyBBWC+tVS1CUQwSNKp+CNJUf5VpBqjUPaqEVQN2HBhotA2OAWCqhM25alOx2cyBQ=="/>
        </item>
        <item>
