            <sparkle:version>2026101601</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>11.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# PEAR 1.0.0

- Adds secure over-the-air update checks using Sparkle 2.
- Adds **Help → Check for Updates…** and a menu-bar update action.
- Preserves the optional menu-bar mode and unresolved-alert badge.
- Keeps the stable PEAR Collector helper separate from routine PEAR interface updates.
]]></description>
